{"displayStem":"담도와 이자관의 연결을 단순화한 독립 제작 모식도다. 검은 짧은 선은 내강을 완전히 막은 위치를 뜻하며 다른 통로는 열려 있다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><rect x=\"60\" y=\"50\" width=\"140\" height=\"70\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"100\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">간</text><ellipse cx=\"390\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"58\" ry=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"365\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">담낭</text><path d=\"M130 120V210H390V142\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M260 210V330H620\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M650 130V330H620\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"580\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">이자관</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">샘창자</text><line x1=\"348\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"348\" y2=\"222\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"6\"></line><text x=\"343\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">온간관</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">온담관</text></svg></div></div>"]}